    "reason": "The defect is that the Load Game faction filter paints each faction's internal identifier instead of its display name. The saved games are the same set either way, so the shortfall exists only in the strings the dropdown draws."
  },
  "fix_commit": "8a1f0ad7ca88b348e80d4123046a6940a58dfceb",
  "issue": {
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "assignee": null,
    "assignees": [],
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body_normalized": "## Issue Summary\n\nThe new game load/save browser doesn't resolve faction display name. Instead it shows just the faction's internal name.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n- start SP mission or Skirmish with non-Random player factions\n- save game\n- open Load game dialog\n- enable filters\n- open Faction dropdown\n\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nFluent string resolved from `FactionInfo.Name` is shown instead.\n\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"415\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e2c5dbd-89f5-4f00-bb2b-5a2b99a20250\" />",
    "body_raw": "## Issue Summary\n\nThe new game load/save browser doesn't resolve faction display name. Instead it shows just the faction's internal name.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n- start SP mission or Skirmish with non-Random player factions\n- save game\n- open Load game dialog\n- enable filters\n- open Faction dropdown\n\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nFluent string resolved from `FactionInfo.Name` is shown instead.\n\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"415\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e2c5dbd-89f5-4f00-bb2b-5a2b99a20250\" />\n\n\n",
    "body_sha256": "d7c46f20c63a1109e00cbcabaa43b67d4a739b3e18e9c3fafdf2ce82396bd301",
